---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Network from '../components/Network.astro';
import NextBand from '../components/NextBand.astro';
---
<Base title="Ripples | Help because you can" description="Ripples is a movement, network and growing collection of conversations built around useful interactions, better questions and ideas worth passing on.">
  <section class="hero belief-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">A movement built one interaction at a time</p>
      <h1>Useful interactions travel <em>further than we see.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Ripples brings together people who believe that helping, sharing what we know and making thoughtful connections can create outcomes none of us could plan alone.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#how-it-works">See how Ripples works</a><a class="text-link" href="/join/">Join the Ripple <span>→</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <Network/>
    <a class="scroll-cue" href="#belief"><span>Start with the belief</span><b aria-hidden="true">↓</b></a>
  </section>

  <section class="belief" id="belief">
    <div><p class="section-label">What we believe</p><h2>Small actions can create <em>unexpected outcomes.</em></h2><p>Ripples begins with the interaction immediately in front of us. We cannot control every result, but we can choose what we put into motion.</p></div>
    <ul><li>Help because you can.</li><li>Make the next interaction count.</li><li>Act with integrity.</li><li>Trust the ripples.</li></ul>
  </section>

  <section class="ecosystem" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-title">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="section-label">One idea, four expressions</p><h2 id="ecosystem-title">Ripples is more than a network.</h2><p>The movement, podcast, network and platform each play a different role. Together, they turn a belief into something people can see, join and carry forward.</p></div>
    <div class="ecosystem-grid">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>The movement</h3><p>The philosophy and behaviour. An invitation to be more intentional about what our interactions set in motion.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>The podcast</h3><p>Conversations about how people think, what shaped them, what changed their minds and what they have learned.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>The network</h3><p>People and relationships forming around shared curiosity, useful introductions and a willingness to contribute.</p></article>
      <article><span>04</span><h3>The platform</h3><p>The place where people, conversations, ideas and the outcomes they create become visible and connected.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="questions">
    <div><p class="section-label">A different starting point</p><h2>Begin with something more useful than <em>“What do you do?”</em></h2><p>A job title is useful context. It is rarely the most interesting thing about someone.</p></div>
    <ul><li>How can you help?</li><li>What are you curious about?</li><li>What could you use help with?</li></ul>
  </section>

  <section class="how" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="section-label">How Ripples works</p><h2 id="how-title">A conversation becomes something worth passing on.</h2><p>The media does not simply promote Ripples. It lets people see Ripples happening, follow the threads and become part of what happens next.</p></div>
    <ol class="journey">
      <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Podcast</h3><p>A real conversation explores how someone thinks, what shaped them and an idea worth passing on.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Social</h3><p>Useful clips, questions and insights help the strongest ideas travel beyond the episode.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Website</h3><p>People follow the person, the thought or the conversation and discover how they connect.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>04</span><div><h3>Participation</h3><p>Someone offers help, asks a question, shares an idea or introduces two people who should meet.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>05</span><div><h3>Connection</h3><p>Useful people and ideas meet through an interaction that would not otherwise have happened.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>06</span><div><h3>The next ripple</h3><p>A new relationship, learning or outcome creates another story and another place to begin.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="podcast-principle">
    <div><p class="section-label">The Ripples Podcast</p><h2>Not simply what did you achieve.<br/><em>How do you think?</em></h2></div>
    <div class="prompt-list"><p>What shaped the way you see the world?</p><p>Who changed your trajectory?</p><p>What do you believe now that you once did not?</p><p>What idea deserves to travel beyond this conversation?</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="participate">
    <div><p class="section-label">Your part in it</p><h2>You do not join an audience.<br/><em>You help create what happens next.</em></h2><p>Share something useful. Ask a worthwhile question. Make an introduction. Pass on a conversation. Tell us what happened because somebody chose to help.</p><a class="button light" href="/join/">Join the Ripple</a></div>
    <ol><li><span>01</span><b>Recognise the belief</b><p>The philosophy means something to you.</p></li><li><span>02</span><b>Take part</b><p>You contribute what you know, need or want to understand.</p></li><li><span>03</span><b>Help it travel</b><p>Your action creates evidence that attracts the next person.</p></li></ol>
  </section>

  <section class="now">
    <div><p class="section-label">Where Ripples is today</p><h2>The network is forming.</h2></div>
    <div><p>Ripples has begun with real people, early connections and a philosophy we are putting into practice. The podcast is being developed. The collection of people, ideas and outcomes will grow only as something real is worth adding.</p><p>There is no membership fee. Ripples is not a lead database or a conventional referral group. Commercial opportunities may emerge, but they are not the only measure of a useful interaction.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pathways" aria-labelledby="pathways-title">
    <div class="section-head"><p class="section-label">Follow a thread</p><h2 id="pathways-title">Start with the person, the thought or the conversation.</h2></div>
    <div class="path-grid">
      <a class="path-card people-path" href="/people/"><span class="rings one" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>People</h3><p>Meet people through what they can share, what they are learning and what help would matter.</p><b>Meet the people →</b></a>
      <a class="path-card ideas-path" href="/ideas/"><span class="rings two" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Ideas</h3><p>Better questions, useful disagreements and things worth learning, crediting and passing on.</p><b>Explore ideas →</b></a>
      <a class="path-card conversations-path" href="/podcast/"><span class="rings three-rings" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3>Conversations</h3><p>Longer conversations about how people think, what shaped them and what changed their minds.</p><b>Explore conversations →</b></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NextBand eyebrow="The next ripple" title="What can you set in motion?" body="Tell us what you can help with, what you are curious about or what you could use help with." href="/join/" link="Join the Ripple"/>
</Base>
